<view class="points-page"><view class="points-hero"><text class="eyebrow">YOUR CARE JOURNEY</text><text class="points-title">每一次护理，值得记下</text><text class="points-number">{{total}}</text><text class="points-caption">当前可用积分 · 以账户入账记录为准</text></view>
<view class="ledger"><text class="ledger-title">积分明细</text><status-view wx:if="{{loading}}" type="loading" title="正在读取积分记录"></status-view><status-view wx:elif="{{errorMessage}}" type="error" title="暂未获取积分" description="{{errorMessage}}" actionText="重试" bind:action="load"></status-view><status-view wx:elif="{{!entries.length}}" title="还没有积分记录" description="符合规则的订单完成后，积分会记录在这里"></status-view><view wx:else><view wx:for="{{entries}}" wx:key="id" class="ledger-row"><view><text class="ledger-reason">{{item.reason}}</text><text class="ledger-time">{{item.createdAt}}</text></view><text class="ledger-amount">{{item.points > 0 ? '+' : ''}}{{item.points}}</text></view></view></view><text class="points-note">积分可在待支付订单中申请抵扣，实际可用数量与抵扣金额由服务端校验。</text></view>
